BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 720 Td (The MSUO kernel uses an asynchronous, best-effort \("fire-and-forget"\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 706 Td (notification mechanism to inform the Licensor's analytics backend of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 692 Td (license usage. Its purpose is to record the most recent known usage of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 678 Td (a license and support aggregate license-usage analytics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 657 Td (The notification is designed to operate independently of the primary) Tj ET
