BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 615 Td (execution or replace the kernel's license verification requirements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 594 Td (Telemetry is intended to be limited to a pseudonymous license identifier) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 580 Td (and a last-usage timestamp. The telemetry mechanism must not transmit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 566 Td (application payloads, business data, application source code, end-user) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 552 Td (content, passwords or private signing keys. Analytics results may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 538 Td (aggregated and anonymized. Where a license identifier or network metadata) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 524 Td (can be linked to an identifiable person, such information is treated as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.18 0.22 0.29 rg 52 510 Td (personal data rather than anonymous data.) Tj ET
